NAME
     chown - change a file's owner or group

SYNOPSIS
     chown [-R] USER[:GROUP] FILE...
     chgrp [-R] GROUP FILE...

DESCRIPTION
     chown sets the owner, and with :GROUP the group as well. Giving a
     file away is root's alone; the owner may change its group to one
     they are in. Called as chgrp it changes only the group.

OPTIONS
     -R   descend into directories

SEE ALSO
     chmod(1), id(1), ls(1)
